WEBVTT

01:34.920 --> 01:37.960
ADAPTED FROM DEMON KING
OF JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:38.040 --> 01:40.960
ORIGINAL WORK BY JIULU FEIXIANG

01:46.200 --> 01:51.960
CANGYAN SEA

01:52.040 --> 01:53.200
You're here.

01:53.280 --> 01:54.480
Come take a look.

02:28.720 --> 02:29.800
Stop.

02:32.520 --> 02:33.520
Pass token.

02:34.480 --> 02:35.320
Pass token?

02:35.400 --> 02:36.680
The Moon Supreme has ordered

02:36.760 --> 02:38.320
that only those with a pass token

02:38.400 --> 02:39.400
may enter Ninth Youxian County.

02:40.520 --> 02:41.600
Yes, I have it.

02:41.680 --> 02:42.600
Wait.

02:50.400 --> 02:52.440
Sir, the token, right?

02:53.400 --> 02:54.240
May I leave now?

02:55.080 --> 02:56.080
Go.

02:56.160 --> 02:57.160
All right.

03:05.400 --> 03:06.800
Life isn't easy for you.

03:07.880 --> 03:09.360
You were doing just fine

03:10.400 --> 03:12.640
but were suddenly dug up
and brought here to accompany me.

03:15.960 --> 03:18.040
We are in the same boat.

03:20.600 --> 03:21.960
Don't worry.

03:22.040 --> 03:23.560
As long as I'm here,

03:23.640 --> 03:25.280
I will be responsible for you.

03:28.760 --> 03:30.120
You almost killed me.

03:30.200 --> 03:32.080
Why are you still watering flowers here?

03:36.280 --> 03:37.680
Jieli, you…

03:41.760 --> 03:42.840
Why are you here?

03:42.920 --> 03:44.160
Don't you have to run the shop?

03:44.240 --> 03:46.160
How dare you mention my shop?

03:46.240 --> 03:47.480
I sent you on an errand,

03:47.560 --> 03:49.440
but you wreaked havoc with others
in Haishi,

03:49.520 --> 03:51.400
ruining my shop and treasures.

03:51.920 --> 03:53.160
If I hadn't run fast,

03:53.240 --> 03:54.520
I would have died.

03:54.600 --> 03:56.600
No, I didn't do that.

03:56.680 --> 03:58.600
They wanted to arrest me for no reason

03:58.680 --> 04:00.320
and were even violent towards me.

04:00.400 --> 04:03.040
Luckily, Dongfang Qingcang saved me.

04:03.120 --> 04:04.480
The Moon Supreme Lord saved you?

04:07.120 --> 04:10.680
It seems the rumor is true.

04:12.040 --> 04:14.080
What rumor?

04:15.040 --> 04:17.680
It is already known
throughout the whole of Ninth You.

04:17.760 --> 04:19.640
I've heard more than 800 romances

04:19.720 --> 04:22.280
about you and the Moon Supreme Lord.

04:22.960 --> 04:24.320
The plot

04:25.800 --> 04:27.640
even makes me blush.

04:28.480 --> 04:29.600
What romance?

04:29.680 --> 04:31.560
Don't listen to them.

04:32.320 --> 04:33.160
By the way,

04:33.240 --> 04:34.200
I also heard that

04:34.280 --> 04:37.000
you saved the Moon Supreme
from the God of War.

04:37.080 --> 04:37.960
Is that true?

04:38.040 --> 04:38.960
I…

04:40.960 --> 04:43.080
It's a long story.

04:43.160 --> 04:45.280
I don't know how to explain it.

04:45.360 --> 04:47.080
It's just a misunderstanding.

04:47.960 --> 04:48.880
All right.

04:48.960 --> 04:50.680
Whatever.

04:51.320 --> 04:54.040
Well, my thousands of years of savings

04:54.120 --> 04:55.480
are all gone.

04:56.360 --> 04:58.920
Yet you are favored and enjoying life
in the Silent Moon Palace.

05:00.240 --> 05:01.200
Listen carefully.

05:01.280 --> 05:03.720
You must take me in

05:03.800 --> 05:05.280
and be responsible for me.

05:05.360 --> 05:07.240
No, you can't stay here.

05:07.320 --> 05:08.680
It's really dangerous here.

05:08.760 --> 05:10.760
How can it be more dangerous than outside?

05:10.840 --> 05:13.080
So many people from Haishi are after me.

05:13.600 --> 05:15.720
It wasn't easy sneaking into the palace.

05:15.800 --> 05:17.440
I don't want to go out and die.

05:17.520 --> 05:18.400
That's not all.

05:18.960 --> 05:19.960
I also want to--

05:20.040 --> 05:21.080
He's here.

05:21.160 --> 05:22.360
Hide yourself.

05:28.240 --> 05:30.400
Moon Supreme Lord.

05:37.160 --> 05:38.480
- I--
- I--

05:43.360 --> 05:45.400
Moon Supreme Lord, what brings you here

05:45.480 --> 05:46.680
to see me?

05:46.760 --> 05:48.240
I want to see you.

05:51.360 --> 05:52.200
See me?

05:52.760 --> 05:53.600
I want to see

05:54.960 --> 05:56.400
if you are fixing the Destiny Book.

05:57.400 --> 05:58.360
Yes.

05:58.440 --> 06:00.200
I wanted to see if you are slacking off.

06:02.520 --> 06:03.560
I…

06:04.480 --> 06:05.360
I…

06:06.800 --> 06:08.760
I can't fix it. I don't know how.

06:09.240 --> 06:11.280
Aren't you Arbiter's head disciple?

06:11.920 --> 06:13.320
Why can't you fix it?

06:14.200 --> 06:15.400
I didn't know

06:15.480 --> 06:17.440
that you were
the Moon Supreme of the Moon Tribe.

06:17.520 --> 06:19.920
That's why I told you
I could fix the Destiny Book.

06:20.000 --> 06:22.800
Then you asked me
to fix the Destiny Book every day.

06:22.880 --> 06:23.920
To be honest,

06:24.520 --> 06:26.480
I thought you were just making small talk.

06:27.040 --> 06:28.240
Now I know

06:29.240 --> 06:31.960
how ridiculous and self-sentimental

06:32.040 --> 06:33.200
I am.

06:34.480 --> 06:36.560
You keep asking me
to fix the Destiny Book.

06:37.160 --> 06:39.160
Is there any special purpose?

06:41.160 --> 06:42.760
Is it related to dealing with Shuiyuntian?

06:48.240 --> 06:49.120
I knew it.

06:53.800 --> 06:56.480
I helped you in front of Lord Changheng

06:56.560 --> 06:58.480
and proved that I am a traitor.

06:59.360 --> 07:01.520
But I won't do anything truly ruinous

07:01.600 --> 07:02.840
to Shuiyuntian.

07:03.400 --> 07:04.960
I ask you to fix the Destiny Book,

07:05.640 --> 07:07.200
but you refuse again and again.

07:08.000 --> 07:10.200
I know you have been kind to me.

07:10.280 --> 07:11.920
You saved me three times.

07:12.000 --> 07:13.120
Haishi.

07:13.200 --> 07:14.080
Yingzhao.

07:14.160 --> 07:15.360
Lord Yunzhong.

07:15.920 --> 07:17.560
But I also saved you once.

07:18.120 --> 07:19.960
You're the inimitable Moon Supreme Lord.

07:20.040 --> 07:21.680
Your life is so valuable.

07:21.760 --> 07:24.080
Your life is worth
at least three times mine.

07:24.880 --> 07:27.720
We're considered even now.

07:27.800 --> 07:30.160
We don't owe each other anymore.

07:35.680 --> 07:37.840
It won't be that easy

07:37.920 --> 07:39.080
to cancel your debts with me.

07:40.520 --> 07:41.560
Let me ask you.

07:42.120 --> 07:44.520
Are you going to fix it or not?

07:45.600 --> 07:48.320
I'm just a mediocre apprentice.

07:48.400 --> 07:51.040
The Destiny Book is in such awful shape.

07:51.120 --> 07:52.160
I can't fix it.

07:52.240 --> 07:53.520
I can't do it.

07:54.400 --> 07:55.760
Very well.

07:59.680 --> 08:01.440
- Jieli.
- Moon Supreme Lord!

08:02.800 --> 08:03.960
Is she your friend?

08:04.560 --> 08:06.680
If I don't see the Destiny Book
in three days,

08:07.240 --> 08:09.360
I will kill her.

08:10.920 --> 08:12.440
- Shangque.
- Yes.

08:12.520 --> 08:14.720
Take her away and guard her strictly.

08:15.360 --> 08:16.480
Yes.

08:16.560 --> 08:17.960
- Let's go.
- Moon Supreme Lord!

08:18.040 --> 08:19.320
My lord, spare my life!

08:19.400 --> 08:20.720
Orchid, save me!

08:22.720 --> 08:24.760
Black Dragon, where are we going?

08:25.680 --> 08:27.000
- Wind Prison.
- Wind Prison?

08:27.080 --> 08:28.360
Black Dragon!

08:28.440 --> 08:29.720
I really didn't commit any crime.

08:29.800 --> 08:31.640
I'm just a vendor in Haishi.

08:31.720 --> 08:33.400
I do business with my conscience.

08:33.480 --> 08:35.600
Quality products, fair prices,
and good business.

08:35.679 --> 08:36.880
Patrons from the Moon Tribe

08:36.960 --> 08:38.280
get a 20% discount!

08:38.360 --> 08:39.400
Black Dragon!

08:39.480 --> 08:41.799
- Black Dragon, listen to me!
- You should've minded your shop.

08:41.880 --> 08:43.200
Why did you sneak into the palace?

08:43.280 --> 08:44.159
It was Orchid.

08:44.240 --> 08:46.720
I sent her on delivery,
but she made a mess in Haishi.

08:46.800 --> 08:47.800
They couldn't catch her,

08:47.880 --> 08:49.240
so they came after me

08:49.320 --> 08:50.960
and chased me all the way to Cangyan Sea.

08:51.040 --> 08:53.080
Black Dragon, I'm just a weak woman.

08:53.160 --> 08:55.080
I came to seek refuge, Black Dragon!

08:55.160 --> 08:56.320
- Let's go.
- Black Dragon!

08:57.280 --> 08:58.320
Trust me.

08:58.400 --> 09:00.720
I'm not lying, Black Dragon.

09:00.800 --> 09:01.640
Listen to me.

09:01.720 --> 09:03.080
- I--
- Shut up.

09:05.400 --> 09:06.800
Let me tell you the truth.

09:06.880 --> 09:08.480
Threatening her to fix the Destiny Book

09:08.560 --> 09:09.800
with my life won't work.

09:10.800 --> 09:11.880
Why not?

09:11.960 --> 09:14.240
I am not close with Orchid.

09:14.320 --> 09:15.520
We don't know each other well.

09:15.600 --> 09:17.840
She comes to my shop just to buy things.

09:17.920 --> 09:19.840
That pauper always runs a tab.

09:19.920 --> 09:21.560
She still owes me
hundreds of spirit stones.

09:21.640 --> 09:23.760
Look, if I die,

09:23.840 --> 09:25.200
she won't have to pay the debt.

09:25.280 --> 09:26.480
Isn't that a great thing for her?

09:26.560 --> 09:27.760
How would the threat work?

09:28.560 --> 09:31.120
What you said makes sense.

09:31.200 --> 09:32.080
Right.

09:32.800 --> 09:34.920
What do you think we should do?

09:35.000 --> 09:36.240
Let me think.

09:37.920 --> 09:39.840
Based on my understanding of Orchid,

09:39.920 --> 09:41.480
it's not difficult to threaten her.

09:41.560 --> 09:43.720
You just have to capture a few fairies

09:43.800 --> 09:44.760
and kill one every day

09:44.840 --> 09:46.160
until she is willing to fix it.

09:46.960 --> 09:48.280
This seems to be a way.

09:48.360 --> 09:50.480
Go and tell the lord

09:50.560 --> 09:51.400
and let me go.

09:52.040 --> 09:53.120
No.

09:53.200 --> 09:54.640
Why not?

09:55.200 --> 09:56.560
Fairy Orchid is sentimental.

09:56.640 --> 09:58.240
If she sees her tribesmen killed,

09:58.320 --> 09:59.600
she will be sad.

09:59.680 --> 10:00.880
Then my lord will be sad too.

10:02.880 --> 10:04.360
People in the Cangyan Sea say

10:04.440 --> 10:06.840
that the lord trusts
his right-hand Black Dragon.

10:06.920 --> 10:08.320
Now that I've met you,

10:08.400 --> 10:10.120
I don't think you know the lord at all.

10:10.840 --> 10:12.160
He's powerful in the three realms.

10:12.240 --> 10:14.080
Why would he be sad over a little fairy?

10:14.160 --> 10:15.400
Who would believe that?

10:16.120 --> 10:17.560
I don't believe it anyway.

10:17.640 --> 10:18.760
What do you know?

10:19.720 --> 10:20.840
Since 38,000 years ago,

10:20.920 --> 10:22.400
I have been at my lord's side.

10:23.000 --> 10:24.760
After his resurrection, I never left him.

10:24.840 --> 10:26.920
He helped Orchid get the Eternal Fire,

10:27.000 --> 10:27.920
make flower soup,

10:28.000 --> 10:29.160
take the immortal examination,

10:29.240 --> 10:30.800
and pursue her lover.

10:31.520 --> 10:33.440
To relieve her longing for Shuiyuntian,

10:33.520 --> 10:36.040
he even built
an exact replica of Arbiter Hall.

10:36.120 --> 10:37.520
I saw it all with my own eyes.

10:46.000 --> 10:47.440
What I just said

10:47.520 --> 10:48.800
are my lord's private matters.

10:48.880 --> 10:50.040
Don't tell anyone.

10:51.600 --> 10:52.480
Otherwise…

10:53.520 --> 10:54.360
This…

10:55.400 --> 10:58.560
Black Dragon, I'm very timid.

10:58.640 --> 11:00.240
Since childhood, whenever I was scared,

11:00.320 --> 11:02.000
not only would my legs move on their own,

11:02.080 --> 11:03.760
but my tongue would also move on its own.

11:03.840 --> 11:05.960
I will babble uncontrollably.

11:06.040 --> 11:07.200
Don't talk nonsense.

11:07.280 --> 11:09.120
Don't lock me up in the Wind Prison.

11:09.200 --> 11:11.400
Then I won't talk nonsense.

11:11.480 --> 11:12.640
This is my lord's order.

11:12.720 --> 11:13.840
It's useless to protest.

11:13.920 --> 11:16.200
The lord only asked you
to keep an eye on me.

11:16.280 --> 11:18.240
He didn't say
we must go to the Wind Prison.

11:18.320 --> 11:19.440
How about this?

11:19.520 --> 11:21.640
Send me back to Orchid,
the woman the lord loves

11:21.720 --> 11:23.960
and the future Moon Queen of Cangyan Sea.

11:24.560 --> 11:25.560
If I stay with her,

11:25.640 --> 11:26.760
I can't run away either.

11:30.040 --> 11:31.960
The woman the lord loves?
The future Moon Queen?

11:32.040 --> 11:33.800
My lord wants to unify the three realms.

11:33.880 --> 11:34.760
As for Orchid,

11:34.840 --> 11:36.640
my lord regards her as a loyal friend.

11:36.720 --> 11:38.880
When have they ever had a love affair?

11:39.360 --> 11:41.360
The many beauties in Silent Moon Palace

11:41.440 --> 11:43.640
are like passing clouds for my lord.

11:43.720 --> 11:45.800
That's it!

11:45.880 --> 11:47.400
Think about what you said.

11:47.480 --> 11:48.440
Doesn't that mean

11:48.520 --> 11:50.320
the lord is among a vast sea of flowers,

11:50.400 --> 11:53.040
but he only looks at this certain orchid?

11:53.120 --> 11:54.800
You've been with the lord every day.

11:54.880 --> 11:56.280
Haven't you noticed it?

11:56.760 --> 11:58.000
Black Dragon,

11:58.080 --> 11:59.600
you seem handsome too.

11:59.680 --> 12:01.440
Why don't you have the wisdom to match?

12:01.520 --> 12:03.120
The relationship

12:03.200 --> 12:04.920
between the lord and Orchid

12:05.000 --> 12:06.920
is very special.

12:07.560 --> 12:09.120
Let me put it this way.

12:09.200 --> 12:11.800
To girls, making soup and getting fire

12:11.880 --> 12:12.960
are trivial matters.

12:13.520 --> 12:15.600
The lord built Arbiter Hall

12:15.680 --> 12:17.720
only because Orchid misses her home.

12:17.800 --> 12:20.680
Say, the Moon Supreme is really something.

12:20.760 --> 12:21.760
He's so rich.

12:23.200 --> 12:25.080
Never mind a luxury palace.

12:25.160 --> 12:27.520
If someone builds a candy shop for me,

12:27.600 --> 12:28.840
I will marry him.

12:28.920 --> 12:31.480
You're always talking about marriage.

12:32.400 --> 12:33.360
You're a girl.

12:34.040 --> 12:34.960
Don't you feel ashamed?

12:35.720 --> 12:37.680
Is that the point?

12:37.760 --> 12:38.640
Black Dragon,

12:38.720 --> 12:40.360
you can train soldiers and fight.

12:40.440 --> 12:42.760
But you don't even understand
the love between men and women.

12:42.840 --> 12:44.680
How can you be considerate

12:44.760 --> 12:46.080
and serve the lord well?

12:50.160 --> 12:51.000
Right?

12:56.360 --> 12:57.520
Think about what I said.

12:57.600 --> 12:58.720
Doesn't it make sense?

12:59.800 --> 13:02.280
It's reasonable.

13:03.200 --> 13:04.240
In that case,

13:04.320 --> 13:05.840
my lord and Fairy Orchid

13:05.920 --> 13:07.240
are a perfect match.

13:07.320 --> 13:08.840
She looks like a Moon Queen.

13:08.920 --> 13:10.160
Of course.

13:10.240 --> 13:12.320
But according to our ancestors' rules,

13:12.960 --> 13:14.760
marriage is prohibited
between our two tribes.

13:15.400 --> 13:16.520
My lord and Fairy Orchid

13:17.440 --> 13:18.800
can't be together.

13:19.880 --> 13:20.800
Think about it.

13:21.360 --> 13:23.440
Is our lord a man who follows rules?

13:25.320 --> 13:26.240
No.

13:26.840 --> 13:28.360
If my lord wants to do something,

13:28.440 --> 13:29.560
no one can stop him.

13:29.640 --> 13:31.160
That's it.

13:31.240 --> 13:33.200
Orchid is the future Moon Queen.

13:33.280 --> 13:36.240
Then I'm the future Moon Queen's friend.

13:36.320 --> 13:38.080
Shouldn't you be nicer to me?

13:39.080 --> 13:40.440
But didn't you just say

13:40.520 --> 13:43.360
that you don't know the Fairy Orchid well?

13:44.280 --> 13:46.560
If I didn't know her well,
would I let her pay on credit?

13:46.640 --> 13:47.920
It's hundreds of spirit stones.

13:48.000 --> 13:49.760
We survived
near-death situations together.

13:49.840 --> 13:51.640
We are closer than sisters.

13:53.120 --> 13:54.000
That makes sense.

13:55.000 --> 13:56.200
Lock her up.

13:56.280 --> 13:57.560
- Yes.
- Yes.

13:59.560 --> 14:01.160
Why are you so stubborn?

14:01.240 --> 14:02.720
- Go.
- Jieli!

14:02.800 --> 14:03.800
Jieli!

14:05.960 --> 14:07.560
Jieli, I'm here to see you.

14:07.640 --> 14:08.480
Orchid!

14:08.560 --> 14:10.480
Orchid, help me.

14:10.560 --> 14:12.120
Don't let him lock me up.

14:14.640 --> 14:17.080
Shangque is very stubborn.

14:17.160 --> 14:18.480
He won't listen to anyone

14:18.560 --> 14:20.000
except for the Moon Supreme.

14:20.080 --> 14:21.800
Then think of something.

14:22.280 --> 14:24.440
All right, I'll try.

14:27.400 --> 14:29.040
Well, Shangque.

14:29.120 --> 14:30.240
Yes.

14:32.920 --> 14:34.920
Can you do me a favor?

14:35.000 --> 14:37.040
Don't lock Jieli up. Hand her over to me.

14:37.880 --> 14:39.000
Yes.

14:48.080 --> 14:50.680
You live well, Orchid.

14:56.800 --> 14:59.400
We finally held off that grouch.

15:00.840 --> 15:03.680
On the way,
I talked so much that I'm thirsty now.

15:03.760 --> 15:04.640
Here you go.

15:14.760 --> 15:16.040
Tell me.

15:16.120 --> 15:17.240
What special relationship

15:17.320 --> 15:18.840
do you have with the lord?

15:19.400 --> 15:21.680
If others offended the lord
the way you did,

15:21.760 --> 15:23.320
they would have died a graveless death.

15:23.400 --> 15:24.600
But you?

15:25.120 --> 15:27.280
You didn't lose a strand of hair.

15:28.480 --> 15:30.000
He and you…

15:31.840 --> 15:33.880
- You two--
- No way.

15:33.960 --> 15:36.600
We are not what you think.

15:37.760 --> 15:39.160
Actually,

15:39.240 --> 15:42.080
I don't know
what kind of relationship we have now.

15:44.280 --> 15:45.800
I have three questions

15:45.880 --> 15:48.200
that can quickly determine
your current relationship.

15:48.800 --> 15:49.720
Do you dare to answer?

15:51.960 --> 15:52.880
Go ahead.

15:53.560 --> 15:54.480
Have you held hands?

15:56.400 --> 15:57.320
Yes.

15:57.400 --> 15:58.680
Have you stayed in the same room?

15:59.760 --> 16:00.800
But…

16:01.800 --> 16:02.920
Tell me.

16:03.000 --> 16:04.760
Don't be shy.
You're thousands of years old.

16:06.640 --> 16:08.960
We were in the same room.

16:09.040 --> 16:10.520
- But--
- Stop.

16:11.160 --> 16:12.560
I don't want to hear the details.

16:13.160 --> 16:14.240
Next question.

16:15.120 --> 16:16.400
Have you two kissed?

16:22.800 --> 16:24.160
We've kissed many times.

16:24.240 --> 16:25.480
But--

16:25.560 --> 16:28.120
My goodness, Orchid.

16:28.200 --> 16:29.280
Without anyone knowing,

16:29.360 --> 16:31.520
you made the lord fall in love with you.

16:32.720 --> 16:33.960
You are really capable.

16:34.560 --> 16:37.360
No, that's not it.

16:39.120 --> 16:40.520
I'll be frank with you.

16:41.640 --> 16:44.080
Dongfang Qingcang was really good to me.

16:44.160 --> 16:45.600
But he also said

16:46.280 --> 16:48.320
that he never had any feelings for me.

16:48.400 --> 16:50.320
It was only because of

16:50.400 --> 16:52.440
something called the One Heart Curse

16:52.520 --> 16:53.880
that he protected me.

16:53.960 --> 16:55.000
He had to take care of me.

16:55.080 --> 16:57.320
Actually, he didn't do it willingly.

16:57.880 --> 16:58.760
That's all?

16:59.920 --> 17:01.040
That's it?

17:01.120 --> 17:03.360
Don't you understand?

17:03.440 --> 17:05.240
His kindness to me is fake.

17:05.319 --> 17:08.240
I'm his weakness
that he can't wait to get rid of.

17:08.319 --> 17:09.839
He was nice to me

17:09.920 --> 17:12.359
because he wanted me
to fix the Destiny Book.

17:19.599 --> 17:21.560
You're still too young.

17:21.640 --> 17:22.800
You don't understand men.

17:25.680 --> 17:27.400
For men,

17:27.480 --> 17:29.800
dignity is more important than life.

17:29.880 --> 17:31.440
He just doesn't want to admit

17:31.520 --> 17:33.920
that he likes a useless fairy like you,

17:34.000 --> 17:36.080
so he made up some curse.

17:36.760 --> 17:38.400
That is just an excuse.

17:42.520 --> 17:44.160
Are you two having a quarrel?

17:44.920 --> 17:46.600
He is forcing you to fix it

17:46.680 --> 17:48.560
to make you give in.

17:50.640 --> 17:51.480
No.

17:52.880 --> 17:54.240
He is the Moon Supreme.

17:54.320 --> 17:55.560
Does that matter?

18:01.520 --> 18:02.960
One-track mind.

18:03.040 --> 18:04.800
Since the Moon Supreme likes you,

18:04.880 --> 18:06.160
why don't you make good use of that?

18:06.720 --> 18:08.080
Make him happy.

18:08.160 --> 18:09.240
In the Silent Moon Palace…

18:09.960 --> 18:12.120
No, in the whole Cangyan Sea,

18:12.200 --> 18:13.920
you will be the hostess.

18:16.680 --> 18:18.400
Jieli is right.

18:18.960 --> 18:20.640
I have to make Big Blockhead happy

18:20.720 --> 18:22.240
in order to escape.

18:25.800 --> 18:28.040
Fine, I'll listen to you.

18:28.760 --> 18:31.240
Teach me how to make him happy.

18:32.000 --> 18:32.960
Come here.

18:45.680 --> 18:46.520
My lord.

18:51.000 --> 18:51.840
What is it?

18:52.320 --> 18:53.480
My lord,

18:53.960 --> 18:55.520
the fairy asks for you at Arbiter Hall.

18:59.080 --> 19:00.840
Has she fixed the Destiny Book so quickly?

19:01.320 --> 19:04.080
I don't know
if it's about the Destiny Book.

19:04.160 --> 19:06.600
She only said
that she would give you a surprise.

19:07.160 --> 19:08.000
A surprise?

19:12.640 --> 19:14.480
I'll be happy
as long as she doesn't shock me.

19:45.480 --> 19:47.320
- Hurry up.
- Will this work?

19:47.920 --> 19:48.840
Of course.

19:49.320 --> 19:51.360
Goodness, don't be nervous.

19:51.440 --> 19:52.440
Smile naturally.

19:53.200 --> 19:54.560
What did I teach you?

19:56.880 --> 19:57.720
Talk about memories.

19:57.800 --> 19:59.120
Yes.

19:59.200 --> 20:01.120
Since you said the lord had built

20:01.200 --> 20:02.680
an exact replica of Arbiter Hall,

20:02.760 --> 20:04.520
that means every moment he spent with you

20:04.600 --> 20:06.160
is deeply imprinted in his mind.

20:06.240 --> 20:07.640
It's so touching.

20:08.960 --> 20:10.640
Come on. Get ready.

20:14.320 --> 20:15.440
At this moment,

20:16.160 --> 20:18.480
you have to hold his hand gently.

20:21.040 --> 20:24.640
Take him past every tree and plant here

20:25.240 --> 20:28.280
to recall the times you spent with him.

20:36.720 --> 20:37.640
What do you think?

20:39.800 --> 20:41.200
It's so corny.

20:41.280 --> 20:43.040
This is called romantic.

20:43.120 --> 20:44.320
Understand?

20:44.400 --> 20:46.040
You aren't romantic at all.

20:46.120 --> 20:47.720
I don't know why the lord likes you.

20:51.000 --> 20:52.320
He's here. I have to go.

20:52.880 --> 20:53.800
Wait, Jieli.

20:53.880 --> 20:54.960
Let me emphasize it again.

20:55.040 --> 20:56.720
No matter what I say or do later,

20:56.800 --> 20:57.640
I do it to escape.

20:57.720 --> 21:00.160
- Don't get me wrong.
- I know. It's just a temporary measure.

21:39.680 --> 21:41.080
Have you fixed the Destiny Book?

21:53.680 --> 21:55.240
I asked you a question.

22:04.360 --> 22:05.520
Not yet.

22:08.040 --> 22:09.520
You keep delaying.

22:09.600 --> 22:11.640
Are you disrespecting me?

22:32.640 --> 22:35.360
Moon Supreme Lord, you are invincible.

22:35.440 --> 22:36.720
You're the best in the world.

22:37.400 --> 22:39.400
Would I dare to disrespect you?

22:42.320 --> 22:43.720
The best in the world?

22:44.960 --> 22:47.200
How do I compare with your Lord Changheng?

22:54.320 --> 22:55.720
Moon Supreme Lord,

22:55.800 --> 22:58.800
you are the strongest in the three realms.

22:59.440 --> 23:01.080
No one can compare with you.

23:05.160 --> 23:06.720
You're sensible.

23:07.800 --> 23:09.040
What?

23:09.120 --> 23:10.800
Do you think that you might die

23:10.880 --> 23:13.240
and now want to flatter me?

23:14.440 --> 23:17.400
I remember that day.

23:17.480 --> 23:20.520
You said

23:21.080 --> 23:23.480
that I was beaten black and blue,

23:23.560 --> 23:25.000
kneeling and begging for mercy.

23:30.080 --> 23:31.440
Wait.

23:31.520 --> 23:33.000
I also made some flower cakes.

23:33.080 --> 23:34.840
Moon Supreme Lord,
would you like to try them?

23:54.520 --> 23:55.400
Is it good?

23:59.560 --> 24:00.520
But the taste

24:01.200 --> 24:02.960
is different from before.

24:04.200 --> 24:06.560
I added the nectar of daylilies to it.

24:06.640 --> 24:08.120
You have been sad recently.

24:08.200 --> 24:09.520
Eating it can cheer you up.

24:12.880 --> 24:15.040
Who told you I was sad?

24:16.040 --> 24:17.520
These days,

24:17.600 --> 24:20.320
whenever I think
of how Shuiyuntian calls me a spy

24:21.160 --> 24:23.520
and no longer welcomes me home,

24:23.600 --> 24:25.000
I feel heartbroken.

24:28.160 --> 24:30.360
You were imprisoned in Haotian Tower
for 30,000 years.

24:30.440 --> 24:32.000
After you got home,

24:32.080 --> 24:33.920
your family didn't welcome you.

24:34.480 --> 24:36.200
How can you not be sad?

24:37.320 --> 24:38.640
Do you mean Xunfeng?

24:50.800 --> 24:53.080
Do you think
that I don't know you're playing tricks?

24:53.640 --> 24:55.000
Fix the Destiny Book now.

24:57.120 --> 24:58.000
Don't go.

24:59.000 --> 24:59.880
Big Blockhead,

24:59.960 --> 25:01.160
I have something to tell you.

25:06.320 --> 25:08.040
Why do you call me Big Blockhead?

25:10.440 --> 25:12.960
Moon Supreme Lord sounds disobliging.

25:13.040 --> 25:14.600
It's scary.

25:14.680 --> 25:17.560
I wouldn't dare to tell you my feelings.

25:17.640 --> 25:19.800
Big Blockhead sounds more intimate.

25:25.520 --> 25:27.120
But if you don't like it,

25:27.200 --> 25:28.920
I won't call you that anymore.

25:32.440 --> 25:34.000
You can call me whatever you want.

25:35.480 --> 25:37.000
What do you want to ask me?

25:38.480 --> 25:40.720
I counted the flowers
in this Arbiter Hall.

25:40.800 --> 25:43.160
There really are 8,452 flowers.

25:44.960 --> 25:46.160
What are you trying to say?

25:48.320 --> 25:50.920
You remember even such a trivial thing.

25:51.000 --> 25:53.200
You remember everything
that happened between us.

25:53.760 --> 25:56.200
Your kindness to me is true.

26:03.960 --> 26:05.360
I am the Moon Supreme.

26:06.360 --> 26:08.360
I am destined to overturn the three realms

26:08.440 --> 26:10.440
and revive the Cangyan Sea.

26:10.920 --> 26:12.120
I told you

26:12.880 --> 26:15.240
that there is no love between us.

26:20.280 --> 26:21.200
I don't believe it.

26:25.440 --> 26:26.720
Do you know what this is?

26:28.920 --> 26:30.000
This is Hellfire,

26:30.560 --> 26:32.560
the most powerful magic
in the three realms.

26:32.640 --> 26:35.080
Aside from Lady Yan,
founder of the Moon Tribe,

26:35.160 --> 26:36.880
you're the only one who can master it.

26:36.960 --> 26:38.480
But do you know

26:38.560 --> 26:40.560
the price that must be paid

26:41.480 --> 26:43.360
to use Hellfire?

26:55.160 --> 26:56.760
The removal of feelings and love.

26:56.840 --> 26:58.480
The eradication of all emotion.

26:59.040 --> 27:00.880
If there is
a shred of emotion in my heart,

27:01.440 --> 27:03.840
I will not have
complete control of Hellfire.

27:04.920 --> 27:06.280
The removal of feelings and love?

27:06.360 --> 27:07.480
That's right.

27:08.760 --> 27:10.920
Whether immortal or human,

27:11.000 --> 27:13.080
all are affected by the seven emotions.

27:13.160 --> 27:16.320
An ancient forbidden technique
was used to remove emotions and love

27:17.320 --> 27:19.240
so that my mood is free from disturbance.

27:20.240 --> 27:21.080
Since then,

27:22.080 --> 27:23.560
even if I were to kill my family,

27:24.160 --> 27:26.000
I wouldn't hesitate.

27:27.600 --> 27:29.760
Nor would I fall in love with anyone.

27:49.200 --> 27:52.640
Father! Kill me, please!

27:56.240 --> 28:00.360
Emotions branch out through the meridians.

28:00.960 --> 28:02.800
When removed, they will regenerate.

28:03.880 --> 28:05.280
If we don't nip them in the bud,

28:06.200 --> 28:08.320
our efforts will be in vain.

28:09.920 --> 28:12.160
Only by removing the root of emotion

28:12.720 --> 28:14.960
can you become

28:15.040 --> 28:16.760
the most powerful in the three realms.

28:16.840 --> 28:17.880
Father!

28:33.800 --> 28:35.160
Now do you understand?

29:03.800 --> 29:05.000
It turns out that

29:05.080 --> 29:07.720
it was your Sea of Emotions
and Seven Emotions Tree.

29:14.040 --> 29:16.440
You know I am devoid of love and emotions,

29:16.520 --> 29:17.920
yet you are not sad

29:18.520 --> 29:20.160
but happy.

29:20.240 --> 29:21.360
Why is that?

29:22.760 --> 29:26.240
So when you said you hated me,

29:26.320 --> 29:27.920
it wasn't true.

29:28.000 --> 29:29.760
Your emotions have just been removed.

29:29.840 --> 29:31.080
You have no choice.

29:31.160 --> 29:32.320
It's not your fault.

29:34.520 --> 29:35.840
Jieli is right.

29:35.920 --> 29:38.160
I should look at your actions instead.

29:38.920 --> 29:40.480
You've done so much for me.

29:41.080 --> 29:42.720
This time, it's my turn.

29:50.600 --> 29:52.360
It's just a Seven Emotions Tree.

29:53.240 --> 29:54.240
You're lucky.

29:54.800 --> 29:57.320
Although I'm a useless fairy,

29:57.400 --> 29:59.600
there are no plants I can't resurrect.

30:06.120 --> 30:07.000
Ridiculous.

30:07.880 --> 30:10.280
My Seven Emotions Tree's roots
have been severed.

30:10.360 --> 30:12.520
Just like an immortal
losing their primordial spirit,

30:12.600 --> 30:14.480
there is no chance of resurrection.

30:15.640 --> 30:18.320
Not to mention
you are a lowly flower spirit.

30:18.400 --> 30:20.080
Even an ancient god

30:20.160 --> 30:21.280
may not be able to do it.

30:22.160 --> 30:23.800
How do you know if you don't try?

30:24.440 --> 30:25.880
My immortal root is damaged.

30:25.960 --> 30:28.800
Everyone said I couldn't pass
the immortal examination.

30:28.880 --> 30:30.000
But not only did I pass,

30:30.080 --> 30:31.280
but I was also the top scorer.

30:33.200 --> 30:35.480
I have wasted half a day with you.

30:36.280 --> 30:38.200
I don't have time for your nonsense.

30:39.200 --> 30:40.080
Daqiang,

30:40.160 --> 30:41.880
I will never give up on you.

30:54.680 --> 30:56.440
An elixir to amplify emotions?

30:57.120 --> 30:58.320
Do you have it?

30:58.880 --> 30:59.720
Yes, I do.

31:01.120 --> 31:02.720
But why do you need that medicine?

31:07.080 --> 31:08.640
What are you going to do?

31:08.720 --> 31:09.840
Jieli.

31:09.920 --> 31:11.360
Jieli.

31:11.440 --> 31:12.640
Jieli.

31:12.720 --> 31:13.920
Why are you leaving?

31:14.000 --> 31:17.560
I'm going to find something that
will give me a fast and painless death.

31:17.640 --> 31:19.960
I thought you had made
the lord fall in love with you.

31:20.040 --> 31:22.560
But who knew he had already removed
his root of emotion?

31:24.120 --> 31:25.320
We're doomed.

31:25.800 --> 31:26.680
Don't panic.

31:26.760 --> 31:28.600
Let's help him cure
his Seven Emotions Tree.

31:28.680 --> 31:29.720
Our lives will be saved

31:29.800 --> 31:31.720
once his root of emotion is recovered.

31:31.800 --> 31:33.880
Besides, he and I are connected

31:33.960 --> 31:35.680
by the One Heart Curse.

31:35.760 --> 31:37.520
If he can experience emotions through me,

31:37.600 --> 31:39.320
his Seven Emotions Tree
will be stimulated.

31:39.400 --> 31:40.840
- Maybe--
- Face reality!

31:40.920 --> 31:43.360
Do you think his Seven Emotions Tree
is the grass in your yard?

31:43.440 --> 31:46.560
Removal of emotions and love is
a legendary ancient forbidden technique.

31:48.120 --> 31:51.200
Jieli, please.

31:51.280 --> 31:53.920
Give me the medicine first, Jieli.

31:54.000 --> 31:55.200
Let go!

31:59.160 --> 32:01.040
What have I done wrong?

32:04.920 --> 32:06.200
Look, here's the thing.

32:06.760 --> 32:08.080
You are buying it on credit.

32:10.200 --> 32:11.800
Thirty spirit stones.

32:12.920 --> 32:13.960
Thirty…

32:15.760 --> 32:17.400
All right, put it on my tab first.

32:17.480 --> 32:19.680
Hey, you still owe me 743 spirit stones!

32:19.760 --> 32:21.160
I haven't even added interest!

32:26.040 --> 32:28.240
As my lord's brother,

32:28.320 --> 32:29.960
Xunfeng should help you revive our tribe

32:30.040 --> 32:31.320
and strengthen the Cangyan Sea.

32:31.400 --> 32:33.680
But now he colluded with Haishi

32:33.760 --> 32:35.840
to usurp power.

32:35.920 --> 32:36.920
It's unforgivable.

32:58.680 --> 32:59.840
First place?

33:00.400 --> 33:01.560
I ranked first in the immortal exam.

33:01.640 --> 33:03.600
I can enter Fountain Palace now!

33:07.560 --> 33:10.280
Fortunately, my lord is both wise, brave,
and prepared in advance.

33:10.360 --> 33:11.560
In an instant,

33:11.640 --> 33:13.080
you thwarted his trickery.

33:13.640 --> 33:16.400
We are deeply impressed
by your lightning-fast action,

33:16.480 --> 33:17.520
my lord.

33:39.480 --> 33:41.720
What is wrong with what I said?

33:53.640 --> 33:55.280
What is she doing?

34:00.040 --> 34:01.000
What is the lord doing?

34:02.920 --> 34:05.000
Xunfeng had ruled
the Cangyan Sea in his place.

34:05.680 --> 34:07.280
It was through force of circumstances,

34:07.360 --> 34:09.760
but he was
the Moon Supreme for 30,000 years.

34:10.239 --> 34:11.760
How could the lord not mind that?

34:12.280 --> 34:13.880
He just has had no chance to punish him.

34:15.159 --> 34:17.040
Now that Xunfeng is seeking death,

34:17.120 --> 34:19.400
the lord can get rid of him justifiably

34:20.520 --> 34:22.120
and naturally feel relieved.

34:43.719 --> 34:45.440
If you're neither an immortal nor a human,

34:46.000 --> 34:47.520
you're from the Moon Tribe.

34:48.199 --> 34:49.920
How could I be from the Moon Tribe?

35:06.000 --> 35:07.200
My lord.

35:07.280 --> 35:08.960
I rebelled against Xunfeng

35:09.040 --> 35:10.840
because I couldn't watch
our tribe be subverted

35:10.920 --> 35:12.720
by an incompetent person.

35:12.800 --> 35:13.840
In my heart,

35:13.920 --> 35:15.520
you are the only Moon Supreme.

35:19.240 --> 35:21.440
I am absolutely loyal to you, my lord.

35:32.760 --> 35:33.800
I suggest

35:34.320 --> 35:38.000
that Xunfeng, the treacherous criminal,

35:38.080 --> 35:39.320
be executed at once

35:39.920 --> 35:41.160
as a warning to others.

35:46.760 --> 35:48.360
Why is the lord suddenly crying?

35:50.280 --> 35:51.200
Well…

35:51.760 --> 35:53.560
After all, they are family.

35:53.640 --> 35:54.520
Killing his brother

35:55.360 --> 35:57.240
is not something the lord could bear.

35:59.280 --> 36:00.280
I overstepped my bounds.

36:00.880 --> 36:03.040
I shouldn't have commented about Xunfeng.

36:03.520 --> 36:04.720
The decision is up to you,

36:05.360 --> 36:06.760
my lord.

36:08.760 --> 36:10.080
Get lost!

36:20.160 --> 36:22.360
Go get my You Jade Ring!

36:22.440 --> 36:24.200
I've ordered someone to get it.

36:24.280 --> 36:25.560
It will be here soon.

36:25.640 --> 36:26.680
What are you looking at?

36:27.240 --> 36:28.120
Stop looking!

36:28.200 --> 36:30.280
Or I'll flay your dragon hide!

36:43.880 --> 36:44.760
My lord.

37:09.200 --> 37:11.920
Bring me Orchid.

37:15.000 --> 37:15.840
Yes.

37:45.280 --> 37:46.200
Go.

37:59.200 --> 38:00.400
Moon Supreme Lord.

38:04.480 --> 38:05.640
My lord.

38:05.720 --> 38:07.200
It really has nothing to do with me.

38:07.280 --> 38:08.800
I only sold medicine to her!

38:09.560 --> 38:11.000
Moon Supreme Lord!

38:11.080 --> 38:12.000
Put her down!

38:12.080 --> 38:14.040
She will be strangled to death!

38:14.120 --> 38:15.200
Jieli!

38:16.080 --> 38:18.240
Did you ever consider that she would die

38:18.320 --> 38:20.360
when you played jokes on me?

38:20.440 --> 38:21.320
Moon Supreme Lord!

38:21.400 --> 38:22.280
I was wrong!

38:22.360 --> 38:23.840
It's all my fault!

38:23.920 --> 38:25.640
I won't do it again!

38:25.720 --> 38:27.600
I won't do that anymore!

38:27.680 --> 38:29.400
Put her down!

38:32.720 --> 38:34.520
Jieli. Are you all right?

38:35.120 --> 38:37.200
If you do it again…

39:20.200 --> 39:21.040
Where are you going?

39:21.920 --> 39:23.600
You still want to go
to Cangyan Sea, right?

39:24.160 --> 39:25.720
I don't want to implicate you and Danyin

39:25.800 --> 39:26.960
to be punished by my brother.

39:27.520 --> 39:29.440
Ronghao, you don't need to know anything.

39:29.520 --> 39:31.120
I'll pretend that you didn't come

39:31.600 --> 39:32.920
to the Fountain Palace today.

39:33.480 --> 39:34.640
But I know everything.

39:35.960 --> 39:37.720
I know you love her deeply.

39:38.320 --> 39:39.480
I know you haven't recovered

39:39.560 --> 39:41.160
and are suppressing your brother's seal.

39:41.240 --> 39:42.240
Your energy is spent.

39:42.800 --> 39:43.720
I also know

39:44.480 --> 39:46.000
that if you go to Cangyan Sea alone,

39:46.680 --> 39:47.560
it will be suicide.

39:47.640 --> 39:48.680
So what?

39:49.960 --> 39:50.960
All these years,

39:51.800 --> 39:53.640
my brother only cared about our reputation

39:53.720 --> 39:55.400
and never let me fall in love with anyone.

39:55.480 --> 39:57.360
I thought being indifferent to her

39:57.440 --> 39:58.680
was protecting her.

39:58.760 --> 40:00.440
But because of this ridiculous thought,

40:00.520 --> 40:02.960
I stood by as I watched her suffer.

40:03.040 --> 40:05.040
Now, she is framed as a traitor

40:05.120 --> 40:05.960
and trapped in Cangyan Sea.

40:06.040 --> 40:07.080
How can I not save her?

40:08.560 --> 40:09.880
Changheng.

40:12.040 --> 40:13.680
Ever since my master died,

40:15.360 --> 40:17.960
you have been
the only person I care about.

40:18.520 --> 40:19.880
Do you want to stop me?

40:20.480 --> 40:21.960
You're injured so badly.

40:22.040 --> 40:23.440
It won't be difficult to stop you.

40:24.000 --> 40:25.120
But I won't stop you.

40:28.120 --> 40:29.360
If I had a chance

40:30.160 --> 40:31.480
to save my master,

40:32.800 --> 40:34.000
what do you think I would do?

40:35.920 --> 40:37.800
You would fight to the death.

40:38.520 --> 40:40.040
Even if you must turn against everyone

40:40.760 --> 40:42.280
or defy the laws of heaven,

40:43.320 --> 40:44.400
you would not hesitate.

40:45.440 --> 40:46.280
There you go.
